attention-weighted coverage 1: patch features { x j } j = 1 N \{x_{j}\}_{j=1}^{N} , CLS attention { a j } \{a_{j}\} ,
tokens in place 𝒜 0 \mathcal{A}_{0} , budget N i N_{i} 2: image-intrinsic evidence 𝒬 i \mathcal{Q}_{i} with | 𝒬 i | = N i |\mathcal{Q}_{i}|=N_{i} 3: C j ​ k ← cos ⁡ ( x j , x k ) C_{jk}\leftarrow\cos(x_{j},x_{k}) for all j , k j,k 4: cov j ← max ⁡ ( 0 , max i ∈ 𝒜 0 ⁡ C i ​ j ) \mathrm{cov}_{j}\leftarrow\max\big(0,\max_{i\in\mathcal{A}_{0}}C_{ij}\big) ⊳ \triangleright 0 0 if 𝒜 0 = ∅ \mathcal{A}_{0}=\emptyset 5: 𝒜 ← 𝒜 0 \mathcal{A}\leftarrow\mathcal{A}_{0} , 𝒬 i ← ∅ \mathcal{Q}_{i}\leftarrow\emptyset 6: for n = 1 , … , N i n=1,\dots,N_{i} do 7: t ⋆ ← arg ⁡ max ⁡ ∑ j t ∉ 𝒜 ⁡ a j ​ relu ​ ( C t ​ j − cov j ) t^{\star}\leftarrow\arg\max_{t\notin\mathcal{A}}\;\sum_{j}a_{j}\,\mathrm{relu}\big(C_{tj}-\mathrm{cov}_{j}\big) 8: 𝒜 ← 𝒜 ∪ { t ⋆ } \mathcal{A}\leftarrow\mathcal{A}\cup\{t^{\star}\} , 𝒬 i ← 𝒬 i ∪ { t ⋆ } \mathcal{Q}_{i}\leftarrow\mathcal{Q}_{i}\cup\{t^{\star}\} 9: cov j ← max ⁡ ( cov j , C t ⋆ ​ j ) \mathrm{cov}_{j}\leftarrow\max\big(\mathrm{cov}_{j},\,C_{t^{\star}j}\big) for all j j 10: end for 11: return 𝒬 i \mathcal{Q}_{i}
